  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to peace consolidation in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;Contribute to the Colombian Government&#xbf;s peace efforts under the &#xbf;Total Peace&#xbf; policy. &lt;/span&gt;Specifically, the action will support government-led peace talks with the armed group (FARC dissidents) &#xbf;Estado Mayor Central&#xbf; (EMC) and urban criminal organizations in the Pacific region. In doing so, the action will put in place a communication strategy to ensure consistency between the current Government&#xbf;s peace initiatives under Total Peace and the implementation of the 2016 Peace Agreement. &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
